    <bpmn:process id="W_W1659" name="W1659. KPI Definition, Target Setting &amp; Cascading Framework" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual strategic planning cycle (W1645) or new KPI introduction
Frequency: Annual review; ad-hoc additions as strategy evolves
Volume: ~100–150 KPIs across all levels (corporate → department → store → individual)
Owner: FP&amp;A
Participants: FP&amp;A, C-Suite, all department heads
Source: workflow W1659 — KPI Definition, Target Setting &amp; Cascading Framework</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1659_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1659_Lane1" name="FP&amp;A">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1659_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1659_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1659_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1659_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1659_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1659_Start3" name="Annual strategic planning cycle (W1645) or new KPI introduction">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1659_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1659_Task4" name="Tier 1 (Corporate)">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: FP&amp;A maintains KPI hierarchy: (a) Tier 1 (Corporate): Revenue, EBITDA margin, net income, cash flow, ROIC, store count, ecommerce penetration, employee engagement — CEO and Board level, (b) Tier 2 (Functional): Category margin, DC fill rate, store sales/sqm, customer NPS, inventory turns, system uptime, turnover rate — C-Suite level, (c) Tier 3 (Operational): POS transaction speed, GR processing time, AP days payable outstanding, AR days sales outstanding, website conversion rate, DC picks per hour — Manager level, (d) Tier 4 (Individual): Sales per associate, picking accuracy, invoice processing time, first-call resolution rate — Individual contributor level
Responsible (R): FP&amp;A
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1659_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1659_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1659_Task5" name="Annual target setting: (a) Tier 1 targets set during strategic planning…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Annual target setting: (a) Tier 1 targets set during strategic planning (W1645), (b) Tier 2 targets decomposed from Tier 1 by C-Suite, (c) Tier 3 targets set by department heads aligned to Tier 2, (d) Tier 4 targets set by managers aligned to Tier 3
Responsible (R): FP&amp;A / C-Suite / Department Heads
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: 2 weeks</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1659_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1659_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1659_Task6" name="KPI governance: (a) each KPI has: name, definition, calculation formula, data…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: KPI governance: (a) each KPI has: name, definition, calculation formula, data source, measurement frequency, target, owner, reporting level, (b) FP&amp;A maintains KPI dictionary; no ad-hoc KPI creation without FP&amp;A review, (c) quarterly: FP&amp;A reviews KPI relevance; proposes additions/modifications to CFO
Responsible (R): FP&amp;A
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: 2 hours/quarter</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1659_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1659_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1659_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1659_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1659_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-341 (ensure controlled execution — Corporate Performance Management (PA-33.2).) | - operational: FP&amp;A review and approval gate
Owner: FP&amp;A</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W1659_Assoc9" sourceRef="W1659_Annotation8" targetRef="W1659_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1659_Flow10" sourceRef="W1659_Start3" targetRef="W1659_Task4" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1659_Flow11" sourceRef="W1659_Task4" targetRef="W1659_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1659_Flow12" sourceRef="W1659_Task5" targetRef="W1659_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1659_Flow13" sourceRef="W1659_Task6" targetRef="W1659_End7" />
    </bpmn:process>
    <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="W1659_diag">
      <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="W1659_plane" bpmnElement="W_W1659">
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W1659_Lane1_di" bpmnElement="W1659_Lane1" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="80" width="950" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
